msgid ""
"A tip was added on the Tyro terminal, but tipping is not enabled for this "
"Point of Sale. It will instead be recorded as a surcharge."
msgstr ""
"Na terminalu Tyro je bila dodana napitnina, vendar napitnine za to prodajno "
"mesto niso omogočene. Namesto tega bo zabeležena kot doplačilo."

